      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Network Traffic Microscope (L3 \u2192 L7 in the kernel)\n\nHubble observes every packet in the kernel datapath. This dashboard surfaces patterns that pcap captures can show but live dashboards almost never do: TCP state-transition mix, ICMP rate, drops by verdict, lost events. Every line is what the kernel actually decided to do."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Volume + integrity",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 110,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total flows/sec",
      "description": "Every L3/L4 flow Cilium decided about.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 111,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(hubble_flows_processed_total[2m])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Drops/sec",
      "description": "Drops are by definition incidents.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 112,
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(hubble_drop_total[2m])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "TCP RSTs/sec",
      "description": "TCP resets \u2014 usually a rude shutdown. Healthy traffic has few.",
