      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Cilium's L7 module can decode HTTP, gRPC, Kafka, and DNS in the datapath. If you have L7 policies loaded, this section lights up. Without L7 policies it's quiet \u2014 load them in Cilium Helm values to enable."
